title: Spaghetti Junction
text: A side road meets the motorway, and three cars need to get across. You only have four flyover ends.
trick: a square of four teleporters makes three flyovers: two corners are each shared by two beams travelling different ways, so four ends carry three crossings
motif: a motorway T-junction: a side road of conduits running into the motorway, the four teleporters at the corners of a square straddling both
ink: 4
expect: shared>=2
